  "sourceTitle": "Iced Tea",
  "sourceText": "Iced Tea\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, December 7, 2009 - 4:34pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 cups Boiling Water\n10 Tea Bags\n1 cup Sugar\n4 cups Cold Water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Boil the water and steep 10 teabags for 5 minutes. 2 Remove Teabags and add 1 cup of sugar, stir well 3 Pour hot tea into cold water and refrigerate.\n\nAbout\n\n\nI find it tastes better after a night in the refrigerator.",
